{"sha": "0b130023d19a65fb750bde403d33a30b67ee3245b44b1d037013006f0ca215e3", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.72]", "  \\clip (-3.4,-1.3) rectangle (4.4,4.3);", "  \\foreach \\x in {-3,...,4}", "    \\foreach \\y in {-1,...,4}", "      \\fill[black!40] (\\x,\\y) circle (1.6pt);", "  \\fill[omDef!12, opacity=0.7] (0,0) -- (1,3) -- (3,3) -- (2,0)", "    -- cycle;", "  \\foreach \\a/\\b in {0/0, 2/0, 4/0, -2/0, 1/3, 3/3, -1/3, -3/3,", "                     2/6, -2/-6, 0/6}", "    \\fill[omThm] (\\a,\\b) circle (2.6pt);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick, ->] (0,0) -- (2,0)", "    node[midway, below, font=\\small] {$(2,0)$};", "  \\draw[omThm, thick, ->] (0,0) -- (1,3)", "    node[midway, left, font=\\small] {$(1,3)$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small $L = \\Z(2,0) + \\Z(1,3)$ 为 $\\Z^2$ 的子格（红", "点）。矩阵 $\\bigl(\\begin{smallmatrix} 2 &", "1\\\\ 0 & 3\\end{smallmatrix}\\bigr)$ 的史密斯标准形为", "$\\operatorname{diag}(1, 6)$：在适配基 $f_1 = (1,3)$，", "$f_2 = (0,1)$ 构成 $\\Z^2$ 的基，则有 $L = \\Z f_1 \\oplus \\Z\\,6f_2$，", "故 $\\Z^2/L \\cong \\Z/6\\Z$ --- 指数等于 $\\abs{\\det} = 6$，", "即阴影基本区域的面积。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{结构定理}", "", "\\begin{definition}\\label{def:b3:modules:torsion}", "设 $A$ 为整环，$M$ 为 $A$-模。称下式所定义的", "\\emph{挠子模}\\index{挠子模}为", "\\[", "T(M) = \\{x \\in M : ax = 0 \\text{ 对某个 } a \\neq 0\\}", "\\]", "（子模：若 $ax = by = 0$，则 $ab(x + y) = 0$，$ab \\ne 0$）。", "$M$ 称为\\emph{无挠}的，若 $T(M) = 0$，", "若 $T(M) = M$，则称为\\emph{挠模}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[主理想整环上有限生成模的", "结构]\\label{thm:b3:modules:structure}", "设 $A$ 为主理想整环，$M$ 为有限生成的 $A$-模。存在", "唯一的 $r \\in \\N$ 及非零非单位元 $d_1 \\mid d_2 \\mid", "\\cdots \\mid d_s$，在相伴意义下唯一，且", "使得\\index{模的结构定理}", "\\[", "M \\;\\cong\\; A^r \\,\\oplus\\, A/(d_1) \\oplus \\cdots \\oplus A/(d_s).", "\\]", "此外 $T(M) \\cong A/(d_1)\\oplus\\dots\\oplus A/(d_s)$，且 $M/T(M)", "\\cong A^r$：主理想整环上有限生成的\\emph{无挠}模", "是自由模。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "\\emph{存在性。}写出 $M \\cong A^n/\\operatorname{im}(C)$", "（见\\cref{rem:b3:modules:presentation}），并将 $C$ 化为史密斯标准形：", "经两次基变换后，$M \\cong A^n / (d_1A \\times \\dots", "\\times d_rA \\times 0 \\times \\dots \\times 0) \\cong A/(d_1) \\oplus", "\\dots \\oplus A/(d_r) \\oplus A^{\\,n - r}$。舍去", "$d_i$ 为单位的因子（$A/(d_i) = 0$）；", "整除链仍然成立。", "", "\\emph{挠的识别。}在该分解中，$A^r$ 是", "无挠的（整环无零因子），且每个 $A/(d_i)$", "是挠的（被 $d_i \\ne 0$ 零化）；直和相应地分解挠，", "即 $T(M) = \\bigoplus_i A/(d_i)$，且 $M/T(M) \\cong A^r$。", "", "\\emph{$r$ 的唯一性}：$M/T(M) \\cong A^r$ 只依赖于 $M$，", "而由\\cref{prop:b3:modules:rank}确定 $r$。", "", "\\emph{$d_i$ 的唯一性}：只需讨论挠模", "$T = T(M)$。将每个 $d_i$ 分解为素元之积，并", "用中国剩余定理（\\cref{thm:b3:rings:crt}；不同素元", "生成互素理想）加以拆分：", "\\[", "A/(d) \\cong \\bigoplus_{p \\mid d} A/\\bigl(p^{v_p(d)}\\bigr):", "\\qquad", "T \\cong \\bigoplus_{p} \\bigoplus_{j} A/\\bigl(p^{k_{p,j}}\\bigr),", "\\]", "即\\emph{初等因子}\\index{初等因子}", "$p^{k_{p,j}}$。反之，$d_i$ 可由初等因子的", "重集重构（$d_s$ 为各素元最高幂之积，依此类推），", "故只需证明", "重集 $\\{k_{p,j}\\}_j$ 由 $T$ 决定，对每个素元", "$p$。固定 $p$；对 $j \\geq 1$，考虑 $A/(p)$-向量空间", "$p^{j-1}T/p^jT$。对循环因子 $A/(p^k)$：", "\\[", "p^{j-1}\\bigl(A/(p^k)\\bigr)\\big/p^{j}\\bigl(A/(p^k)\\bigr)", "\\cong", "\\begin{cases}", "A/(p) & \\text{若 } j \\leq k,\\\\", "0 & \\text{若 } j > k,", "\\end{cases}", "\\]", "而在因子 $A/(q^k)$（$q \\neq p$）上，乘以 $p$ 为", "双射（$p$ 模 $q^k$ 可逆，由贝祖定理），故商", "为 $0$。直和逐项成立：$\\dim_{A/(p)}", "p^{j-1}T/p^jT = \\#\\{i : k_{p,i} \\geq j\\}$。这些内在的", "维数决定指数的重集。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{corollary}[有限生成交换群]", "\\label{cor:b3:modules:abelian}", "每个有限生成交换群同构于 $\\Z^r \\times", "\\Z/d_1\\Z\\times\\dots\\times\\Z/d_s\\Z$，其中 $d_1 \\mid \\dots \\mid", "d_s$，唯一确定。每个\\emph{有限}交换群都是若干", "素数幂阶循环群之积，且作为", "重集唯一。\\index{交换群，结构}", "\\end{corollary}", ""]}